# ── Altium ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Regenerated by Altium on demand; never worth versioning.
History/
__Previews/
Project Logs*/
ProjectLogs/
Project Outputs*/
ProjectOutputs/
Objects/
*.PcbDocPreview
*.SchDocPreview
*.$$$
*.~*
*.Bak
*.BAK

# ── Eagle ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Numbered backups: board (.b#N), schematic (.s#N), library (.l#N).
*.b#*
*.s#*
*.l#*
*.b##
*.lck
# Per-user project settings, not design data.
*.epf

# Eagle CAM output (gerber/drill/pick-place), regenerated from the .brd.
*.cmp
*.drd
*.dri
*.plc
*.gpi
*.stc
*.sol
*.sts

# ── Generated output, either tool ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Release packages belong on a tag, not in history.
Gerbers/
Outputs/
*.LOG

# ── OS / editor noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
